         "id": "#### And what about numbers?\n\nIn the previous lesson, we saw how some indigenous peoples solved their need to count and the relationship of their number system with our body.\n\nTheir number system is not the only one to do this. The numbers used by part of the world today also do something similar, and we will see this in this lesson.",
